WEBVTT

00:00.927 --> 00:07.599
As I stand in the wind on a hill by a port town,

00:00.927 --> 00:07.599
minatomachi oka no ue kaze wo uke

00:07.663 --> 00:14.690
mezurashii kurai atama wa karappo

00:07.663 --> 00:14.690
my head feels unusually empty.

00:15.275 --> 00:21.947
I was watching the town from the south side of the shore.

00:15.275 --> 00:21.947
haruka minami mukougishi de kono machi wo miteita

00:21.972 --> 00:28.186
And so I sunk my unsteady passion into the depths of the sea.

00:21.972 --> 00:28.186
guratsuita jounetsu wo umi ni shizumeta

00:29.080 --> 00:34.752
This surging power...

00:29.080 --> 00:34.752
tome donaku afureru chikara

00:29.080 --> 00:31.167
Black Jack

00:36.254 --> 00:42.509
It's something hidden in everyone, everywhere.

00:36.254 --> 00:42.509
sonnamono wa darenimo dokonimo hisonde iru mono

00:43.303 --> 00:48.265
Day after day, everyone tries their best.

00:43.303 --> 00:48.265
mainichi mainichi minna ganbaru

00:49.836 --> 00:57.191
But people get annoyed when I mention it.

00:49.836 --> 00:57.191
sore wo ieba hito wa mina kemutagaru

00:57.692 --> 00:59.383
Oh FREEDOM

00:59.383 --> 01:01.376
will be there

01:01.396 --> 01:04.356
It makes me glad...

01:01.396 --> 01:04.356
yokatta

01:04.601 --> 01:12.081
That I found my place here.

01:04.601 --> 01:12.081
ibasho ga koko ni attakara

01:12.134 --> 01:13.652
Oh WISDOM

01:13.652 --> 01:15.501
will be there

01:15.529 --> 01:18.170
I searched for the reason

01:15.529 --> 01:18.170
sagashita

01:18.171 --> 01:25.219
why we can believe in the same air

01:18.171 --> 01:25.219
onaji kuuki shinjirarerukoto

01:25.804 --> 01:32.684
as long as we're alive.

01:25.804 --> 01:32.684
ínochi aru kagiri

01:32.685 --> 01:34.770
He weaves the thread of life with his miraculous control of a scalpel.

01:34.854 --> 01:37.038
The genius surgeon who lives on a cape.

01:37.190 --> 01:39.801
His name is Black Jack.

01:51.906 --> 01:54.793
Originally "A Stranger in the Sea" by Tezuka Osamu.

01:51.906 --> 01:54.793
A Dolphin and some Robbers

01:58.083 --> 02:00.343
Coral Shop

02:02.943 --> 02:05.111
Yeah. I was just heading home.

02:05.988 --> 02:07.071
A souvenir?

02:07.072 --> 02:08.072
All right. All right.

02:08.401 --> 02:10.491
But don't hope for too much.

02:14.579 --> 02:18.249
We, need to start getting dinner ready.

02:19.042 --> 02:22.244
We'll make a big meal tonight!

02:53.910 --> 02:55.202
Look, Largo.

02:55.203 --> 02:58.080
The curry looks really good.

03:01.835 --> 03:03.544
What's the matter?

03:15.015 --> 03:16.288
Doc...

03:45.212 --> 03:46.961
Are you awake, Doctor?

03:47.682 --> 03:49.569
We're at sea now.

03:49.841 --> 03:54.053
We're probably about three nautical miles offshore.

04:03.313 --> 04:07.540
Dr. Black Jack, there's someone we want you to look at.

04:07.776 --> 04:12.071
We heard you can miraculously cure any injury.

04:30.507 --> 04:32.967
We attacked an armored car.

04:33.844 --> 04:36.053
That's when he got hurt.

04:37.169 --> 04:40.413
We'll pay you your fair share if you treat him.

04:40.767 --> 04:44.612
If you refuse, we'll toss you overboard and
you'll sink to the bottom of the sea.

04:47.858 --> 04:51.027
Yes. You made a wise choice.

04:58.410 --> 05:00.286
Some of his internal organs are rupturing.

05:00.287 --> 05:02.647
It can be treated, but the bleeding is really bad.

05:03.123 --> 05:04.775
He won't survive without a blood transfusion.

05:05.269 --> 05:06.400
Head back to shore.

05:06.668 --> 05:07.851
Take him to a hospital.

05:08.587 --> 05:10.421
We won't.

05:10.422 --> 05:12.173
We can't do that.

05:12.174 --> 05:15.634
We're going far from here - into foreign waters.

05:16.261 --> 05:19.013
I can't guarantee he'll live if he doesn't get some blood.

05:21.086 --> 05:24.849
If the patient dies, you'll die with him!

05:26.396 --> 05:29.231
He's my brother.

05:31.055 --> 05:33.096
All right. Now let me go.

05:39.910 --> 05:41.369
Hang in there!

05:41.370 --> 05:42.961
Don't die on me.

05:43.288 --> 05:45.285
I can't continue if it keeps swaying like this.

05:45.624 --> 05:46.874
Shut up and keep going!

05:56.435 --> 05:57.762
Are you done already?

05:58.095 --> 05:59.860
What I did is only a temporary fix.

06:00.097 --> 06:02.473
I can't operate properly when the ship keeps swaying.

06:02.572 --> 06:05.226
Will he really be OK like that?

06:05.227 --> 06:06.936
If anything happens to him...

06:19.783 --> 06:21.415
Hey, what's going on?

06:21.576 --> 06:22.368
We've got a problem.

06:22.369 --> 06:23.703
The compass broke.

06:26.039 --> 06:27.331
Is it going to sink?

06:27.776 --> 06:32.238
It shouldn't, but now we can't tell
what direction the ship is going.

06:41.179 --> 06:46.851
Like I've told you a dozen times
already, Doc was kidnapped!

06:47.168 --> 06:49.242
Go get the kidnappers right away!

06:49.438 --> 06:56.144
But still, it's not unusual for him to wander
off on a whim and not return for days.

06:56.445 --> 06:58.480
Doesn't he always do that?

06:59.954 --> 07:01.741
He does not!

07:02.242 --> 07:03.367
Any proof?

07:03.368 --> 07:05.703
I have my instinct as a woman.

07:06.747 --> 07:08.831
It's not enough?

07:08.832 --> 07:14.378
There was a bank robbery today, so we're busy.

07:14.379 --> 07:18.883
If we weren't, I could listen to your little story more.

07:18.884 --> 07:21.052
It's not just a little story!

07:22.637 --> 07:24.180
Sheesh.

07:24.181 --> 07:27.600
Being worried makes me hungry.

07:50.121 --> 07:50.877
All right.

07:53.669 --> 07:56.212
So, Doctor, is the operation over?

07:56.562 --> 07:58.089
The operation's complete.

07:58.090 --> 08:00.299
But he's terribly weak from blood loss.

08:00.842 --> 08:02.409
He needs a blood transfusion.

08:03.725 --> 08:04.970
Then use my blood!

08:05.347 --> 08:06.795
I already told you we can't do that.

08:07.224 --> 08:10.893
Nobody on this boat has his blood type.

08:10.894 --> 08:15.234
Even if you're related by blood, we can't give your
blood to him unless you have the same type.

08:19.582 --> 08:23.839
Where did you think you could go with someone
as injured as this if you didn't even know that?

08:24.282 --> 08:25.790
You are ridiculously reckless.

08:26.118 --> 08:30.287
If you want to make it off of this boat alive, then make
sure he stays alive - no matter what it takes!

08:30.288 --> 08:31.205
Got that?!

08:39.297 --> 08:39.979
Hey.

08:41.216 --> 08:42.967
Where are we now?

08:43.225 --> 08:44.510
Hell if I know!

08:44.625 --> 08:47.430
I told you: the compass broke.

08:47.744 --> 08:51.017
We should have been far from shore by now.

08:51.395 --> 08:52.518
Shut up!

08:52.519 --> 08:53.936
Just shut up!

08:53.937 --> 08:55.271
Man, I'm pissed.

08:56.690 --> 08:59.734
Damn. I can't catch anything!

08:59.735 --> 09:03.446
And all the food we had got washed
overboard by the storm last night!

09:04.465 --> 09:06.479
I'm so starved I could die!

09:06.479 --> 09:07.867
I want to eat something!

09:17.085 --> 09:20.087
Damn you dolphins! You're chasing all the fish away!

09:22.257 --> 09:24.406
So we're lost at sea.

09:24.634 --> 09:27.845
All that money's useless now.

09:34.561 --> 09:36.354
What's he doing now?

09:36.355 --> 09:39.273
I'll get them with this.

09:46.526 --> 09:47.531
Yeah!

09:47.697 --> 09:48.983
What's going on?

09:50.410 --> 09:52.078
What are you doing, Jiro?

09:52.164 --> 09:54.789
I got a big one!

10:00.796 --> 10:01.953
A dolphin?

10:02.255 --> 10:03.775
What are you going to do with it?

10:04.007 --> 10:05.508
What do you think?

10:05.509 --> 10:06.467
Eat it!

10:06.468 --> 10:07.618
We can eat all we want!

10:08.053 --> 10:09.637
Idiot!

10:09.638 --> 10:10.888
We can't eat dolphins!

10:20.356 --> 10:21.565
Damn it!

10:22.818 --> 10:28.114
Somebody! Bring me some instant ramen, and l'll give
you ¥1,000,000 or ¥2,000,000 or whatever you want!

10:30.613 --> 10:32.906
Damn!

11:00.480 --> 11:01.689
Hey! Are you OK?

11:01.718 --> 11:02.185
Hey!

11:02.566 --> 11:04.414
Doctor! What's happening to him?!

11:18.623 --> 11:19.869
What the hell are you doing?

11:20.208 --> 11:22.043
As you can see,

11:22.044 --> 11:24.090
I'm treating the dolphin.

11:24.463 --> 11:25.671
What?

11:25.672 --> 11:28.632
We don't have to let it die here.

11:29.760 --> 11:31.427
Oh that's generous.

11:31.428 --> 11:34.955
You're more concerned about a
dolphin's life than my brother's?!

11:36.829 --> 11:38.309
Don't give me that crap,

11:38.727 --> 11:40.353
you quack!

11:40.354 --> 11:42.021
Go to hell!

11:47.611 --> 11:49.070
Brother...

11:49.571 --> 11:50.922
Brother...

11:51.698 --> 11:52.956
Brother...

11:53.992 --> 11:55.284
He regained consciousness!

11:58.080 --> 12:01.310
Brother, w-where are we?

12:01.500 --> 12:04.085
We're at sea.

12:04.086 --> 12:05.836
We managed to escape.

12:06.242 --> 12:07.963
We'll be on an island soon.

12:07.964 --> 12:09.632
You'll be safe there.

12:09.633 --> 12:10.716
Don't worry.

12:10.717 --> 12:12.093
I'm with you.

12:12.094 --> 12:13.344
We have a doctor with us too.

12:13.345 --> 12:14.553
We'll all be fine.

12:17.808 --> 12:18.724
Let me see him.

12:20.505 --> 12:21.279
So?

12:21.687 --> 12:23.062
Don't get your hopes up yet.

12:23.063 --> 12:24.509
His heart's beating irregularly.

12:24.773 --> 12:26.143
Is there anything you can do?

12:26.400 --> 12:28.706
We can try giving him a vasopressor,

12:29.152 --> 12:31.529
if you still refuse to take him to a hospital.

12:35.909 --> 12:38.208
Thanks, Doctor.

12:44.018 --> 12:48.513
Man, I could at least tell the direction
we're going if I could see the stars.

13:12.529 --> 13:14.572
I got a nibble!

13:15.073 --> 13:15.906
What?!

13:16.033 --> 13:17.408
Give it to me!

13:17.409 --> 13:18.409
One sec!

13:20.871 --> 13:23.372
Oh, it's just some rotten seaweed.

13:27.336 --> 13:29.102
Hey, is it good?

13:29.338 --> 13:31.630
Give me some too!

13:31.631 --> 13:32.506
Hey!

13:33.550 --> 13:36.552
Damn you! You didn't leave any for me!

13:36.652 --> 13:39.364
Damn, I'm hungry!

13:39.492 --> 13:41.766
Damn it! Damn it!

13:42.809 --> 13:44.853
Thank you, Doctor.

13:45.937 --> 13:46.979
What are you doing?

13:47.481 --> 13:48.600
See for yourself.

13:52.694 --> 13:56.106
Who told you to put that dolphin next to my brother?!

13:57.866 --> 13:59.367
Hey! Stop it!

13:59.826 --> 14:01.160
Brother, don't!

14:01.161 --> 14:02.078
Stop it.

14:03.497 --> 14:04.362
Tomo!

14:05.613 --> 14:06.426
Are you OK?

14:06.466 --> 14:07.669
Don't move.

14:08.126 --> 14:10.744
The dolphin's hurting too.

14:11.046 --> 14:12.505
That poor thing.

14:24.059 --> 14:25.851
I'm so thirsty...

14:27.938 --> 14:30.497
We'll all die at this rate.

14:36.488 --> 14:38.781
How are you?

14:41.952 --> 14:45.663
It sounds like you can understand what I'm saying.

14:45.664 --> 14:48.708
Doctor, has the dolphin recovered?

14:49.209 --> 14:50.183
Not yet.

14:51.461 --> 14:55.673
But it'll recover faster than you.

14:55.888 --> 14:56.888
Why not?!

14:57.009 --> 14:59.135
You'll never know until we actually try to eat it!

14:59.594 --> 15:00.710
No!

15:02.834 --> 15:06.308
You just ate something right!in front of me!

15:06.582 --> 15:08.519
As if that was enough!

15:08.777 --> 15:09.937
What?

15:09.938 --> 15:13.566
Then I'll stick my hand in your mouth and pull it out!

15:18.518 --> 15:19.697
Spit it out!

15:30.334 --> 15:33.419
Those wounds will reopen if you swim too much.

15:33.420 --> 15:34.896
So take it easy.

15:35.630 --> 15:36.464
Good.

15:36.465 --> 15:37.631
Good boy.

15:42.054 --> 15:42.938
Bye.

15:43.263 --> 15:44.764
My precious dolphin!

15:44.765 --> 15:45.833
Shut up!

15:47.267 --> 15:49.004
My food!

15:49.186 --> 15:52.449
Damn you. What'd you do that for?!

15:58.111 --> 15:59.612
Don't get any crazy ideas.

15:59.613 --> 16:03.282
He threw our only food overboard.

16:03.378 --> 16:04.218
That's unforgivable.

16:04.592 --> 16:05.576
Stop it!

16:05.577 --> 16:08.204
My brother's life depends on this doctor.

16:08.269 --> 16:09.582
I don't care!

16:09.790 --> 16:11.874
My life comes first!

16:11.875 --> 16:13.376
What?!

16:18.882 --> 16:19.924
Stop it!

16:19.925 --> 16:20.800
Stop moving!

16:20.801 --> 16:22.468
This boat is leaking.

16:27.224 --> 16:29.517
It's small, but there's a leak in the bottom.

16:29.518 --> 16:31.268
You can see it in the cabin.

16:31.269 --> 16:32.478
So don't move around.

16:32.479 --> 16:33.646
Stay still as much as you can.

16:38.610 --> 16:42.321
Doctor, what's going to happen to us?

16:42.322 --> 16:43.531
Who knows?

16:52.457 --> 16:53.791
There's a plane...

16:54.312 --> 16:57.022
Hey! Help!

16:57.212 --> 16:58.337
Stop it!

16:58.338 --> 16:59.505
Do you want to get caught?!

16:59.963 --> 17:01.632
It's better than dying here!

17:03.051 --> 17:04.520
That's true...

17:04.678 --> 17:06.706
Dying here means we lose everything.

17:07.222 --> 17:08.941
Help!

17:08.473 --> 17:10.276
Help!

17:10.726 --> 17:13.310
I'll give you this much if you save us!

17:13.456 --> 17:15.494
Help!

17:16.815 --> 17:18.816
Hey, how do you use this?

17:19.526 --> 17:20.693
Is that a flare?

17:20.694 --> 17:23.946
Damn. The print's so faded I can't read it.

17:23.947 --> 17:25.990
Hurry up, or it'll be gone!

17:25.991 --> 17:29.078
Do something!

17:29.286 --> 17:30.578
I know!

17:30.646 --> 17:31.377
Hey!

17:31.611 --> 17:32.787
Damn!

17:40.297 --> 17:45.134
They're already so far away that
they'd never see us anyway.

17:46.428 --> 17:49.327
Has even the sun betrayed us?

17:49.598 --> 17:53.810
We could at least drink if it rained.

17:52.809 --> 17:55.102
I'm tired of this!

17:56.938 --> 17:58.105
What are you doing?

17:58.106 --> 17:59.569
Get off the boat!

17:59.858 --> 18:00.524
What?!

18:00.525 --> 18:03.486
The boat will sink at this rate.

18:03.487 --> 18:05.404
You're all too heavy!

18:05.405 --> 18:06.656
Get off the boat!

18:06.890 --> 18:08.366
What are you saying?

18:08.367 --> 18:09.700
Do you want to jump off alive?

18:09.701 --> 18:12.787
Or do you want me to shoot you and then throw you off?

18:12.788 --> 18:14.038
I'll let you choose.

18:14.039 --> 18:15.267
Don't!

18:16.625 --> 18:17.833
Damn you!

18:19.044 --> 18:20.961
You first, Doctor!

18:20.962 --> 18:23.297
Jump off the boat before l count to five.

18:23.298 --> 18:26.342
I'll shoot you if you don't.

18:26.442 --> 18:27.510
One.

18:27.827 --> 18:28.969
Two.

18:29.974 --> 18:31.138
Three.

18:31.360 --> 18:32.717
Four.

18:35.102 --> 18:36.102
Walk.

18:38.598 --> 18:40.811
Now! Jump!

18:41.191 --> 18:42.203
Jump off!

19:02.087 --> 19:03.004
A dolphin...

19:03.005 --> 19:04.046
It's that dolphin!

19:06.174 --> 19:07.888
Don't swim.

19:08.135 --> 19:10.635
Your wound hasn't healed yet.

19:10.804 --> 19:13.014
Don't interrupt me!

19:14.641 --> 19:16.225
Hey! Stop it!

19:16.268 --> 19:17.101
Let go!

19:17.373 --> 19:18.561
Jiro...

19:22.774 --> 19:23.607
Look!

19:23.608 --> 19:25.693
He's swimming ahead of the boat!

19:28.332 --> 19:30.906
Is he trying to lead the boat?

19:30.907 --> 19:32.283
What?

19:32.326 --> 19:33.124
Start the boat!

19:33.368 --> 19:34.618
And follow that dolphin!

19:34.619 --> 19:35.745
We just may make it!

19:49.911 --> 19:52.636
Doctor, the dolphin's bleeding!

19:52.637 --> 19:53.554
Enough!

19:53.555 --> 19:55.306
That's enough!

19:56.767 --> 19:57.850
You've shown us the right direction!

19:57.851 --> 19:59.477
You'll die if you swim any more!

19:59.478 --> 20:00.478
Stop now!

20:00.479 --> 20:05.024
He must be trying to save you since you saved him.

20:05.025 --> 20:06.469
That dolphin...

20:15.619 --> 20:16.952
It's land...

20:16.953 --> 20:18.329
I can see land!

20:26.296 --> 20:28.673
Hey! I apologized already!

20:28.674 --> 20:32.385
You can have some of my share, so free me!

20:39.017 --> 20:42.520
Those are the Coast Guard's boats!

20:43.939 --> 20:47.483
That dolphin brought us right back to where we started.

20:58.870 --> 20:59.954
Please...

20:59.955 --> 21:01.914
Please take my brother to a hospital.

21:02.153 --> 21:03.291
Don't Worry.

21:03.667 --> 21:05.133
I'll get an ambulance.

21:08.672 --> 21:09.691
Thanks.

21:13.427 --> 21:15.386
Doc!

21:15.595 --> 21:16.847
Doc!

21:17.264 --> 21:19.015
I was so worried!

21:19.016 --> 21:21.280
How did you know you'd find me here?

21:21.560 --> 21:24.437
That policeman told me.

21:24.688 --> 21:27.897
Man, I never thought it'd actually
turn out to be a real kidnapping!

21:27.899 --> 21:30.735
I told you so!

21:30.736 --> 21:31.402
Huh?

21:31.403 --> 21:33.154
There's something floating over there.

21:33.155 --> 21:34.238
What is that?

21:34.813 --> 21:35.699
What?

21:41.580 --> 21:42.831
That bandage is...

21:43.081 --> 21:46.292
What about that bandage?

21:55.260 --> 21:57.088
Are we going home?

21:57.304 --> 21:59.680
Thank you for the souvenir by the way.

22:00.432 --> 22:02.544
It's so cute!

22:10.550 --> 22:17.556
I want to capture your heart with my silly smile.

22:10.550 --> 22:17.556
itazura no hohemi de muchuu ni sasetaino

22:17.557 --> 22:24.729
Only look straight at me.

22:17.557 --> 22:24.729
massugu na kimi no me ni watashi wo utsushitene

22:24.774 --> 22:32.031
Being kind isn't good enough.

22:24.774 --> 22:32.031
yasashii dake dewa nanika tarinaino

22:32.032 --> 22:42.541
I want to get in touch with your true heart, deep
within the you that nobody else sees.

22:32.032 --> 22:42.541
dare nimo misenai kokoro no oku no sotto furetai

22:42.542 --> 22:47.922
Being in the gentle sunlight,

22:42.542 --> 22:47.922
yawaraka na hizashi abite

22:47.923 --> 22:57.306
I wish on the clover that plays the melody of dreams,

22:47.923 --> 22:53.128
yume wo kanaderu clover

22:53.583 --> 22:57.307
kaze ni negai wo nosete

22:57.307 --> 23:08.067
and I search for a ray of hope beyond the blue skies,

22:57.307 --> 23:08.067
aoi sora no mukou e kibou no hikari sagasuno

23:08.068 --> 23:13.155
because I want to stay by your side forever.

23:08.068 --> 23:13.155
zutto soba ni itakara

23:13.156 --> 23:26.126
The promise we made long ago in a far away place...

23:13.156 --> 23:26.126
haruka kanata de zutto mae kara

23:26.127 --> 23:33.050
is finally coming to a realization, overcoming the incredible distance,

23:26.127 --> 23:33.050
hikari ni terasare michibikareru youni

23:33.051 --> 23:43.936
just as it was lead by the light.

23:33.051 --> 23:36.984
sora no hate tooku

23:37.077 --> 23:43.877
toki wo koete ima tadori tsuku

23:45.143 --> 24:15.125
A Challenge from an Unknown Being

23:45.457 --> 23:49.010
Abdol damral omnis nomnis elues horimak...

23:50.230 --> 23:51.636
Aye-aye!

23:51.883 --> 23:53.303
Someone wanted you here.

23:54.077 --> 23:55.757
You weren't called here.

23:55.782 --> 23:57.090
I've been waiting for you.

23:57.403 --> 23:58.450
Where's Sharaku?

23:58.624 --> 24:01.484
We've all been called here for specific tasks.

24:02.820 --> 24:03.447
Sharaku!

24:03.699 --> 24:06.920
I won't allow you to hurt someone
just so you can test me!

24:11.567 --> 24:14.575
Next Karte - A Challenge from an Unknown Being.

24:16.147 --> 24:17.773
Karte NG...

24:19.526 --> 24:21.860
Look! He's swimming...

24:21.861 --> 24:22.486
Hey!
